    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Choose 1</strong></p>\n<h5>Predator</h5>\n<p>You have advantage on <em>Unarmed Strikes</em> and <em>Weapon Attack Rolls</em> against a creature if at least one of your allies is within 5 feet of the creature you are targeting.</p>\n<h5>Prey</h5>\n<p>You can take the <strong>Dash, Dodge, or Disengage Actions</strong> as a Bonus Action on your turn.</p>\n",
